  "identity": "A GW Kithkin tribal midrange deck that kills with a CUMULATIVE anthem stack over a wide, uniformly-typed token board. Champion of the Clachan's static 'Other Kithkin you control get +1/+1' persists across turns; Timid Shieldbearer x2 repeat '{4}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1' every turn there is spare mana; Gallant Fowlknight x2 closes with 'creatures you control get +1/+0 ... Kithkin creatures you control also gain first strike'. Five anthem effects across 23 nonland cards, fed by five token producers. All 12 creature copies are Kithkin-typed, which makes Winnowing a free reset -- but Winnowing is a MATCHUP-DEPENDENT reset, not the kill mechanism: see winnowing_asymmetry_ledger.",
